Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:15.169 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  solidarity has always been at the heart  of the European community seventy years  ago on May the 9th 1950 Robert Schumann  made a revolutionary declaration with  Europe ravaged by the Second World War  Schumann planted the seed from which the  European community of peace grew and  blossomed former enemies reached out  their hands in reconciliation and became  friends we opened borders and tore down  the walls between us we built the  world's biggest internal market with the  continent to reunified the European  family finally  again against all odds we built a unique  society in Europe where we can live  together in peace and solidarity today  70 years after the Schumann declaration  Europeans are confronted with the  deepest crisis since the second world  war too many have lost loved ones are  fighting for their own lives or are  afraid of losing their jobs their  livelihoods their future still in the  midst of today's crisis the European  spirit of solidarity was rekindled  leaving borders open for critical  transports of food and medical goods  helping EU citizens travel safely home  supporting neighboring countries with  medical staff investing massive  resources to find a vaccine in the midst  of this crisis new heroes had emerged  [Music]  they are our inspiration now we are  called upon to walk in the footsteps of  Schumann to write the next chapter in  our history it is time to rebuild Europe  with a new recovery plan and a heart it  is time for a Europe where workers have  a good job to return to after the crisis  where companies receive a helping hand  especially in hard-hit sectors Europe  where we harvest the energy of Sun wind  and water to fuel our cars homes and  factories a Europe where we join forces  and invest in research to give citizens  the health care they need it is time to  help each other become stronger together  it's time to be brave to stand up and  build a better future it is time to make  history again  [Music]

